1
00:00:43,209 --> 00:00:46,533
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:49,536
=Episode 11=

3
00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:50,760
Drink it!

4
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,680
Good.

5
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:58,040
Gu Xiaotang? What are you doing here?

6
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,800
Director Li.

7
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:02,480
I'm still with the company, aren't I?

8
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:05,080
Isn't it only right
that I entertain the clients?

9
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,200
Fine, glad you have some sense.

10
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,120
Mr. Wang.

11
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:16,880
Sorry I'm late.

12
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,280
Let me toast to you.

13
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:20,000
Having you drink with me in person,

14
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:21,560
I'm honored.

15
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,560
Cheers!

16
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:26,000
But Mr. Wang,

17
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:29,280
I'd suggest you skip this drink.

18
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:31,280
Why is that?

19
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:36,240
Didn't you just have a checkup?

20
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:38,280
Let me tell you a secret.

21
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:40,320
Once the report comes in,

22
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:43,160
you'll find you have
late-stage liver cancer.

23
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:50,400
Are you crazy? What are you saying?

24
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,440
Are you cursing me?

25
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:53,760
You know your own body best.

26
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:56,720
Didn't you say
your upper right back often aches?

27
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:59,080
The pain gets much worse at night.

28
00:01:59,080 --> 00:02:00,520
No pain patches help at all.

29
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:03,400
You used to love greasy food,

30
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:06,160
especially braised pork belly.

31
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:08,960
Thinking about it now,
does it make you sick?

32
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,800
Xiaotang.

33
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,960
Let me introduce everyone.

34
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:17,800
This is my old classmate, Ye Shen.

35
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:20,320
He's a doctor
and a specialist in this field.

36
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:21,800
I specially brought him here for you.

37
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:26,120
Mr. Wang, your complexion looks unwell.

38
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,600
Your eye whites look yellowish.

39
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:30,960
Do you feel any pain
around here usually?

40
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:34,360
What are you trying to say?

41
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,360
Mr. Wang, let me see your hand.

42
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,560
Look here.

43
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:40,600
The base of your palm
is noticeably reddened,

44
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:42,600
a classic liver palm sign.

45
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,920
This is a liver palm?

46
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:47,880
And look here. This is a spider nevus.

47
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,320
Combined with the pain here,

48
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,160
it shows that his liver
has severe damage.

49
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,200
What...

50
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,840
Didn't you always say

51
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:59,360
Mr. Wang's upper right back
aches at night?

52
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:04,760
Mr. Wang, didn't you say
it was neck strain?

53
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:07,360
Mr. Wang, when the liver
suffers severe damage,

54
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:09,280
the pain radiates
to the upper right back.

55
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:11,600
I strongly advise you
to get to a hospital right now

56
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,800
for a full checkup.

57
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:16,280
You must listen to the doctor, Mr. Wang.

58
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,840
It's your own health on the line.

59
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,000
Drinking so hard

60
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,360
and indulging like crazy

61
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,680
are going to kill you.

62
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:24,040
You don't have much time left.

63
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:27,040
Focus on how you want to spend
your remaining days

64
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,280
instead of

65
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,680
being a bully.

66
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:37,160
Zhang, Chen, let's go.

67
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:39,440
Mr. Wang. Mr. Wang.

68
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:41,000
Don't go.

69
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,000
How long does he have?

70
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:44,120
Six months at most.

71
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,240
Six months.

72
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:48,480
That's enough to teach him
how to act right.

73
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:59,400
Mr. Wang. Mr. Wang,
it's a misunderstanding.

74
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,840
Get lost!

75
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,080
What?

76
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,960
(Jinle Palace Business Club)
Your cash cow ran away?

77
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,960
Gu Xiaotang, you jinx!
You ruined my life's work!

78
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:13,800
I ruined your life's work?

79
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:16,160
Are you out of your mind?

80
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:18,560
What ruined your work
was your own greed and incompetence.

81
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:21,000
You grovel before Lu Qingyuan
like a lapdog,

82
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,840
betting everything on someone
who would toss you aside anytime.

83
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:24,840
Nonsense!

84
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,280
Lu Qingyuan can bring me resources

85
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,280
and money.

86
00:04:27,520 --> 00:04:28,800
What can you give me?

87
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,040
I can give you dignity.

88
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:37,080
What do you mean?

89
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,560
Work with me.

90
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,880
I can put you in control
of your own destiny.

91
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,520
(Debt and Medical Bill Agreement)
Sign this.

92
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:51,120
Wipe out all debts
for the newcomers and Mei,

93
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:54,560
and cover all of Mei's mother's
medical bills.

94
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:55,880
Are you insane?

95
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,320
Do you think I run a charity?

96
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,400
Don't you want to know where Xia Na is?

97
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Where is she?

98
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:05,320
Once I marry Lu Qingyuan,

99
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:07,600
Xia Na will be your
only moneymaker, won't she?

100
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,000
Now she's gone missing.

101
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,560
Tell me where Xia Na is!

102
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,480
Sign this, and I'll tell you.

103
00:05:14,127 --> 00:05:15,390
(Debt and Medical Bill Agreement)

104
00:05:17,536 --> 00:05:20,536
(Outpatient Clinic)

105
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:23,240
Hold on, baby, don't rush.

106
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,920
I'll come see you after work.

107
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:31,200
Miss Gu? What brings you here?

108
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:33,840
Would you like another check-up
for your injury?

109
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:36,520
Director Zhang, I'm here
for my best friend Xia Na.

110
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,240
Where is she?

111
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:39,640
Ms. Xia Na?

112
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,400
She woke up and left on her own.

113
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:43,400
She's not here.

114
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,880
Did you get the wrong place?

115
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,240
Since Director Zhang doesn't know

116
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:48,240
and we can't reach her,

117
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:49,840
let's call the police.

118
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:53,120
Sure, let the police do their job.

119
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:57,200
When they do, who knows
what they might see?

120
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,240
Guys.

121
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:05,080
Follow me.

122
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,480
Kidney transplant surgery.

123
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,200
Who is Xia Na donating her kidney to?

124
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:30,000
Lu Qingyuan's mother.

125
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,120
- How do you know?
- It doesn't matter how I know.

126
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:36,880
Anyway, your cash cow
is about to become useless.

127
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,600
She couldn't have signed this.

128
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,360
Miss Gu,

129
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,760
well, the law is about evidence.

130
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:45,000
Mr. Lu was just too worried.

131
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,360
Though the procedure was a bit hasty,

132
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:49,040
the signature is valid.

133
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:51,720
Director Zhang, I also examined Xia Na.

134
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:54,760
Her kidney is not a match.

135
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,760
Who are you? What do you know?

136
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:04,760
Ye Shen?

137
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,560
You're Dr. Ye!

138
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,800
It's an absolute honor!

139
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:12,320
I've always admired you.

140
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:14,520
I never thought I'd meet you here.

141
00:07:15,320 --> 00:07:17,200
But the report clearly shows...

142
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:19,600
Are you questioning me,

143
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,600
Director Zhang?

144
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:23,400
Of course not.
You're the expert on this.

145
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:25,280
However...

146
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:33,040
So you didn't even know
if the kidney type matched?

147
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,400
And you locked up my artist here?

148
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:38,600
With just this surgical consent form,

149
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,960
I could sue your hospital
into bankruptcy.

150
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:43,280
I'm taking Xia Na with me today!

151
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:45,040
No, you can't take her.

152
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:48,160
Lu Qingyuan made us do all this.

153
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,440
Go find him if you dare.

154
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:50,800
Don't threaten me here!

155
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:54,840
So you're throwing the blame
on my fiance?

156
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,960
From what I know,

157
00:07:57,960 --> 00:08:00,560
Lu Qingyuan's the only reason
this hospital is still running.

158
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:03,160
If he finds out what you just said,

159
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:05,080
how do you think he'll react?

160
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:08,640
Director Zhang,

161
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:12,720
I have a way
to get you out of this dilemma.

162
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:15,120
The choice is yours.

163
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:23,960
Director Zhang, how is she?

164
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,880
When can we schedule the surgery?

165
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,240
Given Ms. Xia Na's physical indicators,

166
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,320
for safety's sake,

167
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:33,760
I think we need
to re-verify the kidney match.

168
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,840
No need. Schedule the surgery quickly.

169
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:40,480
But if it's not a match,
someone could die.

170
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,200
Director Zhang,

171
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:46,560
let's not beat around the bush.

172
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:50,760
You really think I didn't know
Xia Na's kidney wasn't a match?

173
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:53,600
I suspected the report
was wrong all along.

174
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,840
Then why are you...

175
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:03,280
My mother agreed to sign the will
before going into surgery.

176
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:07,000
Once the will is signed,
does anything else matter?

177
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:12,840
Don't worry.

178
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,440
Just prep the surgery.

179
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:29,680
See that?

180
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:32,080
If you do the surgery,
you'll be an accomplice to murder.

181
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,600
If you don't,
he'll still come after you.

182
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,600
Miss Gu, Dr. Ye,

183
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:38,720
did you hear all that?

184
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,520
I recorded what he said.

185
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:43,480
Lu Qingyuan is a monster!

186
00:09:43,480 --> 00:09:45,000
He's trying to kill his own mother.

187
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,200
Right, there's one more thing.

188
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:50,200
He did a matching test himself at first.

189
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:52,120
And... and it turned out he was a match.

190
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:54,080
He was worried about his own health.

191
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:57,680
So he forced me
to forge a mismatched report.

192
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,880
H-He never wanted to donate his kidney.

193
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,480
You made me a promise.

194
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,480
Give me the recording.

195
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,944
Pleasure working with you.

196
00:10:31,920 --> 00:10:32,920
I'm begging you.

197
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:35,960
I'll do anything
as long as I'm not involved.

198
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,080
I'll think about it.

199
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:40,400
Miss Gu, what can I do?

200
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:12,920
Mr. Lu, your taste in wine
isn't that great at all.

201
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,520
Are you crazy?

202
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,200
Spit it out already.

203
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:21,840
Mr. Lu, here's the thing.

204
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:27,480
I heard you're taking Xia Na
for a kidney transplant.

205
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:31,640
Who told you that?

206
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,080
Relax, relax.

207
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,360
Just tell me if it's true or not.

208
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,200
You're bluffing?

209
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,680
You should've seen your face.

210
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:50,760
Do you think I only have one copy?

211
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,320
What do you want?

212
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,000
Look, Mr. Lu.

213
00:11:58,040 --> 00:12:00,360
Let's make a deal.

214
00:12:00,680 --> 00:12:02,120
Fifty million.

215
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:04,720
Once the money hits my account,
I'll destroy the evidence.

216
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:13,360
Are you threatening me?

217
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:15,840
Lu Qingyuan,

218
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:18,840
who do you think you are?

219
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,720
Without the Lu family, you're nothing.

220
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:25,984
Want to outshine your brother?

221
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:27,320
Let me tell you,

222
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:29,120
you're not even worthy
to shine his shoes.

223
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:34,440
You're just a piece of trash
who plays dirty

224
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:37,600
and would even harm his own mother.

225
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:42,760
If I were you,
I'd be too ashamed to stay alive.

226
00:12:44,400 --> 00:12:46,400
Call me when you've made up your mind.

227
00:12:49,664 --> 00:12:50,816
Darn you!

228
00:12:58,080 --> 00:12:59,200
How dare you threaten me?

229
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:01,312
Darn you!

230
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:04,280
Calling me useless? Threatening me?

231
00:13:12,128 --> 00:13:13,312
Darn you!

232
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,600
Calling me trash?

233
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,360
You asked for it!

234
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,600
Someone!

235
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:37,560
Mr. Lu. Mr. Lu.

236
00:13:38,480 --> 00:13:39,480
The surgery.

237
00:13:39,640 --> 00:13:41,640
I don't care where. Do it right now.

238
00:13:41,640 --> 00:13:44,440
B-But the paperwork still takes time...

239
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:46,840
I don't care! Do it now!

240
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:48,680
- Hurry!
- Okay, I'll set it up right away.

241
00:14:04,141 --> 00:14:09,720
(In operation)

242
00:15:05,175 --> 00:15:08,531
♪The face deep in the heart♪

243
00:15:08,723 --> 00:15:11,185
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

244
00:15:12,560 --> 00:15:16,260
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

245
00:15:16,471 --> 00:15:18,911
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

246
00:15:19,058 --> 00:15:21,430
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

247
00:15:21,580 --> 00:15:24,337
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

248
00:15:24,337 --> 00:15:26,658
♪Even for just a second♪

249
00:15:28,003 --> 00:15:31,466
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

250
00:15:31,594 --> 00:15:33,443
♪And sunlight reverses♪

251
00:15:33,443 --> 00:15:36,913
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

252
00:15:37,269 --> 00:15:39,343
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

253
00:15:39,845 --> 00:15:43,254
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

254
00:15:43,511 --> 00:15:48,723
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

255
00:15:49,977 --> 00:15:52,542
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

256
00:15:52,584 --> 00:15:56,037
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

257
00:15:56,614 --> 00:15:59,577
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

258
00:16:00,322 --> 00:16:02,930
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

259
00:16:02,930 --> 00:16:06,553
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

260
00:16:07,023 --> 00:16:11,079
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
